10 REM KALEIDOSCOPE - MACHINE CODE DRAWS, BASIC ASKS
20 REM BLOCK AT 768, PARAMETERS IN ITS FIRST THREE BYTES, ENTRY CALL 771
30 REM FOUR PASSES IS HALF A MINUTE OF DRAWING ON THIS DISPLAY
40 INPUT "SEED (0-255)",S
50 INPUT "TWIST (0-255)",T
60 INPUT "PASSES (1-4)",N
70 IF N<1 THEN N=1
80 IF N>4 THEN N=4
90 POKE 768,ABS(S) MOD 256
100 POKE 769,ABS(T) MOD 256
110 POKE 770,N
120 CALL 771
130 REM THE NEXT PROMPT IS THE WAIT - A REAL KEYPRESS WOULD STOP THE PROGRAM
140 GOTO 40
